orig_q:
\textbf{Question} 

Match each of the set on the left described in the roster form with the same set on the right described in the set-builder form:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item[$(i)$] $\{P, R, I, N, C, A, L\}$
    \item[$(ii)$] $\{0\}$
    \item[$(iii)$] $\{1, 2, 3, 6, 9, 18\}$
    \item[$(iv)$] $\{3, -3\}$
\end{enumerate}

\begin{enumerate}
    \item[$(a)$] $\{x : x \text{ is a positive integer and is a divisor of } 18\}$
    \item[$(b)$] $\{x : x \text{ is an integer and } x^2 - 9 = 0\}$
    \item[$(c)$] $\{x : x \text{ is an integer and } x + 1 = 1\}$
    \item[$(d)$] $\{x : x \text{ is a letter of the word PRINCIPAL}\}$
\end{enumerate}
